  "type": "MULTIPLE_CHOICE",
  "data": {
    "body": "Three statements are given about a series $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}a_n$ with all $a_n\\geq0$.\n\n(I) If $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}a_n$ is divergent, then $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}(a_n)^n$ is divergent.\n\n(II) If $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}a_n$ is convergent, then $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}(a_n)^n$ is convergent.\n\n(III) If $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}a_n$ is convergent, then $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}(a_n)^2$ is convergent.\n\nSelect all TRUE statement(s) from above.",
    "solution": [
      3
    ],
